WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.998 --> 00:00:08.845
The home page shows «Needs attention this week» and today's work.

2
00:00:08.845 --> 00:00:15.417
The side menu is grouped: Lessons, Planning, Assessment, Classes, Communication.

3
00:00:15.821 --> 00:00:19.686
In «Long-term plan» you choose a class.

4
00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:25.034
Lessons are listed by topic, each topic's test beside it.

5
00:00:25.034 --> 00:00:30.115
«Assign tests» assigns tests from the plan automatically.

6
00:00:30.115 --> 00:00:34.750
First «Preview» – it writes nothing, then «Confirm».

7
00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:43.234
«Who did what» – score per student, ✗ – not taken.

8
00:00:53.124 --> 00:00:59.189
The «KSQ / BSQ» section: exams, paper variants and results.

9
00:00:59.189 --> 00:01:05.625
Print the sheet, scan it – the score is calculated automatically.

10
00:01:06.024 --> 00:01:10.773
The «Journal page» – attendance and grades by date.

11
00:01:10.773 --> 00:01:15.789
«Analytics and reports» – statistics by class and student.
